DRAWER 5, LEE MORTAL WORLD, FEMALE
គំនូរទី 6, KIM AFTERLIFE, FEMALE

445
00:19:06.019 --> 00:19:07.437
មាន John Doe នៅទីនេះ។

446
00:19:07.521 --> 00:19:08.438
DRAWER 2, John DOE, MALE

447
